  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Monitoring and Implementation Committe JOMIC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kommitt&#xe9;n f&#xf6;r &#xf6;vervakning av GPA, JOMIC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to enhance the capacity of the Joint         Monitoring and Implementation Committee to carry out its mandate,     laid down in the Global Political Agreement, i.e. building peace and  tolerance among grassroots communities, reducung violence and         conflict before the next elections, promoting broader national        healing and reconciliation. Joint support of 5 donors.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xd6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rka JOMICs (Joint monitoring and      Implementation Committee) kapacitet att utf&#xf6;ra det mandat man har     fr&#xe5;n Global Political Agreement, dvs att bygga fred och tolerans i    lokalsamh&#xe4;llet, att minska p&#xe5; v&#xe5;ldet och konflikterna inf&#xf6;r n&#xe4;sta     val, att fr&#xe4;mja bredare nationell f&#xf6;rsoning. Programmet st&#xf6;ds         gemensamt av 5 givare.</narrative>
  </description>
